meta {
  name: Get Enrolled Courses
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/my-courses
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Enrolled Courses
  List courses saved or enrolled by the authenticated founder.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - User enrolled courses list.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  [
    {
      "id": "enr_1",
      "courseTitle": "FinTech Compliance & RBI Master Directions",
      "progressPercent": 40,
      "status": "in-progress"
    }
  ]
  ```
}
